# Planning/working-notes docs — personal notes, kept local only, not in git.
# See CLAUDE.md's own note on this for why and what that means for a fresh clone.
# Moved into docs/ 2026-08-31 (Whereabout -> Forin rename); CLAUDE.md itself
# stays at root — Claude Code auto-loads it only from there.
/CLAUDE.md
/docs/HANDOFF.md
/docs/design-preferences.md
/docs/whereabout-client-design.md
/docs/whereabout-data-architecture.md
/docs/whereabout-scratch-notes.md
/docs/language-app-system-design.md
/docs/app-design-doc.md
/docs/state-dept-data-handoff.md

# wrangler files
.wrangler
.dev.vars*
